# Node.js version (AtlasDocs)

This repo pins **Node.js 22** via `.nvmrc`.

Before any `npm`, `npx`, Vitest, Vite, or Playwright command:

1. Run `nvm use` (or otherwise switch to Node 22).
2. Confirm with `node -v` — it must start with `v22`.
3. Do **not** use Homebrew Node 26+ (or any major other than 22) for this project.

Playwright under the wrong Node version can hang at webServer startup with no useful error. If that happens, stop and fix the Node version — do not retry indefinitely.

Also use the project `.venv` Python for uvicorn/e2e (`playwright.config.ts` already prefers `.venv/bin/python`).
